			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "n2",
			"originalText": "Groups RECORDS per partition; ready batches for the\nsame broker travel in ONE ProduceRequest.\nAdds no wait of its own when linger.ms = 0.",
