		{
			"id": "EFBoyzV1",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 158.45751953125,
			"y": 4223.75,
			"width": 783.0849609375,
			"height": 112.5,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#f59e0b",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [
				"bK9uco5RHU4qMFBd-U_BQ"
			],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b1c",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 432462343,
			"version": 6,
			"versionNonce": 1873742219,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795749712362,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "records/batch ≈ rate per partition × min(time to fill, linger)\n• Throughput climbs steeply at first, then flattens (broker CPU, replication).\n• Latency grows with linger.ms only when batches do NOT fill. No universal best: measure.\n• buffer.memory is a safety valve, not a speed knob (bigger = backpressure arrives later).\n• p95/p99 in short runs are noisy (warm-up, JIT): trust p50, repeat runs, use medians.",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "tk",
			"originalText": "records/batch ≈ rate per partition × min(time to fill, linger)\n• Throughput climbs steeply at first, then flattens (broker CPU, replication).\n• Latency grows with linger.ms only when batches do NOT fill. No universal best: measure.\n• buffer.memory is a safety valve, not a speed knob (bigger = backpressure arrives later).\n• p95/p99 in short runs are noisy (warm-up, JIT): trust p50, repeat runs, use medians.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
