		{
			"id": "ZQCZLp6c",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1479.9960021972656,
			"y": 1570,
			"width": 940.0079956054688,
			"height": 90,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#f59e0b",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [
				"KuQpITKnDpKYvtnEq9qcJ"
			],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b1cwV",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 946708167,
			"version": 6,
			"versionNonce": 1512678245,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795749732744,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "How long is the window? From the ack until the slowest electable follower has fetched.\nMilliseconds when healthy — but a lagging follower can stay in the ISR up to replica.lag.time.max.ms (30 s),\nso the window is longest exactly when the cluster is stressed.\nmin.insync.replicas does NOTHING for acks=1 (leader accepts writes even with ISR = itself).",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "c2wn",
			"originalText": "How long is the window? From the ack until the slowest electable follower has fetched.\nMilliseconds when healthy — but a lagging follower can stay in the ISR up to replica.lag.time.max.ms (30 s),\nso the window is longest exactly when the cluster is stressed.\nmin.insync.replicas does NOTHING for acks=1 (leader accepts writes even with ISR = itself).",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
