			"updated": 1795749732744,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "acks=all survives (m − 1) simultaneous broker failures, m = min.insync.replicas.\nCopies at ack time:  acks=0 → unknown   ·   acks=1 → exactly 1   ·   acks=all → at least 2.\nReplication copies MISTAKES too: it protects against machines, not against humans.",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "c2ft",
			"originalText": "acks=all survives (m − 1) simultaneous broker failures, m = min.insync.replicas.\nCopies at ack time:  acks=0 → unknown   ·   acks=1 → exactly 1   ·   acks=all → at least 2.\nReplication copies MISTAKES too: it protects against machines, not against humans.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null,
