			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "acks buys certainty about ONE kind of failure: a broker dying.\nRetries are no cure for acks=1: they trigger on errors, and the loss happens AFTER a success.\nKeep two reference runs: acks=all (check C passes under a broker kill) and acks=1 (check C may fail).",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "c2tk",
			"originalText": "acks buys certainty about ONE kind of failure: a broker dying.\nRetries are no cure for acks=1: they trigger on errors, and the loss happens AFTER a success.\nKeep two reference runs: acks=all (check C passes under a broker kill) and acks=1 (check C may fail).",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
