			"updated": 1795749744078,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Sizes are exact and repeatable. Speed numbers are NOT a codec ranking:\nthe generator ran in a 1-CPU container shared with a broker, one run each.\nData: synthetic EventPulse-shaped JSON (~341 B, random UUIDs). Real data differs: re-measure.",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "c4cv",
			"originalText": "Sizes are exact and repeatable. Speed numbers are NOT a codec ranking:\nthe generator ran in a 1-CPU container shared with a broker, one run each.\nData: synthetic EventPulse-shaped JSON (~341 B, random UUIDs). Real data differs: re-measure.",
