			"updated": 1795749744078,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "K2 hypothesis: with 1-CPU brokers the broker is the scarce resource ⇒ zstd/snappy may RAISE throughput;\nif the API's CPU is the bottleneck, compression LOWERS it. Measure producer CPU, broker CPU, bytes/record.",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "c4q9",
