			"updated": 1795749749878,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "The batcher's 5 s clock sits OUTSIDE the library. When it fires the waiters get a 503,\nbut nobody cancels the library's batch — it may still be written later (zombie write).",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "c5bn",
			"originalText": "The batcher's 5 s clock sits OUTSIDE the library. When it fires the waiters get a 503,\nbut nobody cancels the library's batch — it may still be written later (zombie write).",
