			"updated": 1795749749878,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "The caller usually sees only TWO things: success, or a TIMEOUT after the limit ran out.\nThe real reason (NOT_ENOUGH_REPLICAS, no leader…) is mostly hidden inside the library.\nParcel service: the customer was told \"no\" while the courier is still delivering.",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "c5q0",
			"originalText": "The caller usually sees only TWO things: success, or a TIMEOUT after the limit ran out.\nThe real reason (NOT_ENOUGH_REPLICAS, no leader…) is mostly hidden inside the library.\nParcel service: the customer was told \"no\" while the courier is still delivering.",
			"autoResize": true,
