			"updated": 1795749749878,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Choosing values: make retries large and let the DELIVERY TIMEOUT be the bound\n(one number then answers 'how long do we try'). Never set backoff to 0.\nJava rule: delivery.timeout.ms ≥ linger.ms + request.timeout.ms.",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "c5o5",
			"originalText": "Choosing values: make retries large and let the DELIVERY TIMEOUT be the bound\n(one number then answers 'how long do we try'). Never set backoff to 0.\nJava rule: delivery.timeout.ms ≥ linger.ms + request.timeout.ms.",
