			"updated": 1795749749878,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Retries do NOT hide a failover: with 5 fast retries the library fails in ~3 s, so clients see a burst of\n503s lasting roughly the failover time, then normal service. Memory stays flat the whole time.",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "c5z",
			"originalText": "Retries do NOT hide a failover: with 5 fast retries the library fails in ~3 s, so clients see a burst of\n503s lasting roughly the failover time, then normal service. Memory stays flat the whole time.",
