			"seed": 310284457,
			"version": 6,
			"versionNonce": 479025829,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795749755390,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "What the key buys you\n• per-key ordering (needs idempotence + in-flight ≤ 5, notes 3 and 5)\n• locality: one consumer sees all of a key, so per-key state/aggregation is cheap\n\nWhat it costs you\n• load follows the key distribution, not the partition count\n• partition count N becomes part of the routing function",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "c6q0",
			"originalText": "What the key buys you\n• per-key ordering (needs idempotence + in-flight ≤ 5, notes 3 and 5)\n• locality: one consumer sees all of a key, so per-key state/aggregation is cheap\n\nWhat it costs you\n• load follows the key distribution, not the partition count\n• partition count N becomes part of the routing function",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
