			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Design question before choosing a key:\n\"Is the busiest key's rate small compared with what ONE partition can handle?\"\nIf no, the key (not the cluster) is the bottleneck.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "c6m3",
			"originalText": "Design question before choosing a key:\n\"Is the busiest key's rate small compared with what ONE partition can handle?\"\nIf no, the key (not the cluster) is the bottleneck.",
