			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Summary\nkey → partition → order and load.   N caps consumer parallelism.\nSkewed keys cap throughput at one partition.   Changing N re-routes keys.\nChoose the key and N early; both are expensive to change later.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
