			"seed": 892555849,
			"version": 7,
			"versionNonce": 2125325131,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795749759662,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Why this design\n• ONE queue and ONE timer: no per-request timers, flat memory, easy to reason about\n• pump() is the only place a batch is cut and sent ⇒ no races between triggers\n• the batcher NEVER retries (the library does): one outcome per batch\n• a batch is all-or-nothing: every waiter gets the same verdict\n• batching here is layer 1; client linger (note 1) and the broker log are layers 2 and 3",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "c7q0",
			"originalText": "Why this design\n• ONE queue and ONE timer: no per-request timers, flat memory, easy to reason about\n• pump() is the only place a batch is cut and sent ⇒ no races between triggers\n• the batcher NEVER retries (the library does): one outcome per batch\n• a batch is all-or-nothing: every waiter gets the same verdict\n• batching here is layer 1; client linger (note 1) and the broker log are layers 2 and 3",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"created": null,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
