			"text": "Unbounded queue (naive)\nwaiters pile up → memory grows\n→ latency climbs → OOM kill\n⇒ failure moves to the whole pod",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
