			"updated": 1795749759662,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Waits stack: queue wait (≤ 5 ms normally, up to the queue timeout under load) + send time.\nWorst-case request latency = queue wait + send timeout (≈ 10 s, note 5).\nA bounded queue turns 'slow' into 'rejected fast'.",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "c7d2",
			"originalText": "Waits stack: queue wait (≤ 5 ms normally, up to the queue timeout under load) + send time.\nWorst-case request latency = queue wait + send timeout (≈ 10 s, note 5).\nA bounded queue turns 'slow' into 'rejected fast'.",
