			"text": "Summary\none queue, one timer, one pump() ⇒ simple and race-free\nbounded in count AND bytes ⇒ overload becomes a fast 503\nsettle-once ⇒ timeout and late ack cannot both win\nin-flight = 1 ⇒ order is safe but the ceiling is batch ÷ RTT\ndrain with a deadline ⇒ clean shutdown without lost waiters",
